The file-watcher policy and the content-hash file manifest in
`src/stele/codeintel/` are a Python reimplementation of CodeGraph's design:
its `watcher.ts` platform/WSL2 watch policy and its SQLite `files` table
(path, content_hash, mtime, indexed_at) that gates re-indexing and powers
staleness reporting. CodeGraph is TypeScript; stele's port is independent
Python over `watchfiles` + stdlib `sqlite3`. Full license:
https://github.com/colbymchenry/codegraph/blob/main/LICENSE
